Subject: [PATCH 1/2] test(app): renew two fixtures that merged laws made stale

The wrapped-A golden of microarc_test_part takes one more chord on one
turning arc: arc_chords (8f99bcb4c) bounds the step by the curvature law
when the two radii differ, and #2386 made the golden on an older base.
Only that hunk is copied, not the Windows rounding of a full rewrite.

framed_stock_chamfer_live_refusal_keeps_hint_without_local_move_number
rides at mid-wall (Z10), not at the stock top. A 10-degree plane at the
top crosses the top face along a line that is no edge, and the #2435
wall law (#2450) refuses it correctly. The asserts do not change.

guide_projects::demo_projects_build_and_load_with_valid_paths passes on
2c789ed6d and needs no change.

Decision: docs/decisions/2483-main-red-fixtures.md.

Fixes #2483

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
