Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(app): clear the needless-borrow clippy lint in
 region_z

Clippy on main fails at heights.rs:128 after #2488, and the batch tier
runs clippy. The closure only borrows, so it is passed by value. The
decision file names the follow-ups #2520 and #2521.

Fixes #2483

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
